{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45241","headline":"九日同卢使君幼平吴兴郊外送李司仓赴选 · 皎然","name":"九日同卢使君幼平吴兴郊外送李司仓赴选","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重阳千骑出，送客爲踟蹰。\n旷野多摇落，寒山满路隅。\n晴空悬蒨斾，秋色起菱湖。\n几日登司会，扬才盛五都。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45241.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45241","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}